# Set baseUrl (HTTPS origin without a trailing slash) and accessToken in your private HTTP client environment.
# Short routes require the installation-specific Nginx configuration.
# Both data routes accept the same JSON body and bearer token.

### Short health route: 200, status ok
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Compatibility health route: 200, status ok
GET {{baseUrl}}/model-catalog/health
Accept: application/json

### Short data route, one known model: 200, found
POST {{baseUrl}}/data
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":["gpt-6-sol"]}

### Short data route, batch with an unknown model: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/data
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":["gpt-6-sol","nonexistent-model-for-http-test"]}

### Short data route, empty batch: 200, empty array
POST {{baseUrl}}/data
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":[]}

### Short data route, missing token: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/data
Content-Type: application/json

{"models":["gpt-6-sol"]}

### Short data route, invalid token: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/data
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-for-http-test

{"models":["gpt-6-sol"]}

### Short data route, invalid body: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/data
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":"gpt-6-sol"}

### Compatibility data route, one known model: 200, found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":["gpt-6-sol"]}

### Compatibility data route, batch with an unknown model: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":["gpt-6-sol","nonexistent-model-for-http-test"]}

### Compatibility data route, empty batch: 200, empty array
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":[]}

### Compatibility data route, missing token: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{"models":["gpt-6-sol"]}

### Compatibility data route, invalid token: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-for-http-test

{"models":["gpt-6-sol"]}

### Compatibility data route, invalid body: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/models/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"models":"gpt-6-sol"}
